WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.270
Jeremy paddled the boat across the pond.

2
00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:12.977
Rain poured down.

3
00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:18.760
"Oh no," Tom said. "I'm getting wet!"

4
00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:21.681
Jeremy put on a raincoat.

5
00:00:21.682 --> 00:00:27.765
But Tom didn't have a raincoat.

6
00:00:27.766 --> 00:00:33.741
Then Tom spotted a pail.

7
00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.889
He put it on his head.

8
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:42.041
Tom smiled. "Now I will stay dry!"

9
00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:46.254
Suddenly Tom felt something slimy.

10
00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:52.156
A worm slid down Tom's face.

11
00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:55.577
Another one crawled along his arm.

12
00:00:55.578 --> 00:00:58.953
Worms climbed into his pocket.

13
00:00:58.954 --> 00:01:03.951
Tom laughed. "Worms are funny!"

14
00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:07.493
Jeremy stopped paddling and frowned.

15
00:01:07.494 --> 00:01:12.509
"Tom! Those worms are for fishing!"

16
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:18.202
Tom gave Jeremy some worms.

17
00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:29.706
Jeremy put a worm on his hook.

18
00:01:29.707 --> 00:01:34.077
Jeremy and Tom waited for a while.

19
00:01:34.078 --> 00:01:42.179
The rain stopped.

20
00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:46.071
"Where are all the fish?" Tom asked.

21
00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:56.858
Jeremy laughed. "In the water."

22
00:01:56.859 --> 00:02:01.163
Tom sighed.

23
00:02:01.164 --> 00:02:05.113
"Fishing is boring," he thought.

24
00:02:05.114 --> 00:02:08.990
"And I need to find Mother's flowers."

25
00:02:08.991 --> 00:02:11.652
Thump. Thump.

26
00:02:11.653 --> 00:02:14.293
Something bumped into the boat.

27
00:02:14.294 --> 00:02:16.196
Tom jumped.

28
00:02:16.197 --> 00:02:22.802
"What was that?" he said.

